ns depending on whether commercial refrigeration equipment must meet higher efficiency standards."}],"plainSummary":"This joint resolution would cancel a Department of Energy rule that set stricter energy efficiency standards for commercial refrigerators, freezers, and similar equipment used by businesses. The rule, published in January 2025, would have required this equipment to meet new energy conservation standards by January 2029. If this resolution passes, those updated standards would be eliminated and the equipment would not need to comply with the new requirements.","classificationMethod":"llm","plain":{"whoItTouches":"Anyone who buys food.","confidence":"crs-summary"},"topOverlap":{"bioguideId":"N000189","score":0.0257116644139778},"overlapCount":14},"meaning":{"percentile":82.6093824040436,"median":0.010636331736930488,"n":6331,"ordinary":[],"unattributedShare":0.4215177380147314}},{"billId":"119-hr-2902","bioguideId":"N000189","cycle":2026,"score":0.007169909053470897,"matches":[{"industry":"insurance","donorAmount":5000,"donorShare":0.011423244932648548,"billConfidence":0.6,"contribution":0.002916573174293246},{"industry":"pharma","donorAmount":2500,"donorShare":0.005711622466324274,"billConfidence":0.9,"contribution":0.0021874298807199348},{"industry":"health-providers","donorAmount":2500,"donorShare":0.005711622466324274,"billConfidence":0.85,"contribution":0.002065905998457716}],"method":{"formula":"score = Σ_industries ( donorShare(industry) × billWeight(industry) ), where billWeight = classifierConfidence / Σ classifierConfidence. Range 0–1, read as a weighted share of disclosed itemized money.","donorProfileCycle":2026,"billClassificationMethod":"llm","unclassifiedDonorShare":0.4215177380147314},"bill":{"id":"119-hr-2902","congress":119,"billType":"hr","billNumber":"2902","title":"SOAR Act of 2025","introducedDate":"2025-04-10","latestActionDate":"2025-04-10","latestActionText":"Referred to the Committee on Energy and Commerce, and in addition to t